<title>ESTONIA: BALTIC 30 INDEX UP 1.13 PCT TO 119.98.</title>
<headline>BALTIC 30 INDEX UP 1.13 PCT TO 119.98.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic 30 index, the only pan-Baltic  index, which is compiled by the three leading business newspapers,  rose by 1.13 percent to 119.98 on Thursday, Estonia's Aripaev said.</p>
<p>The Baltic 30 index covers the 10 leading stocks from the three Baltic  stock markets and is compiled by Aripaev, Lithuania's Verslo Zinios  and Latvia's Dienas Bizness.</p>
<p>The index started from 100 on May 19.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
